      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the main problem here is not the versions_with_info attribute. It\u0027s the fact that min_sdk_version is required to build in AOSP and breaks the build in sc-mainline-prod. Is it feasible to cherry-pick to sc-mainline-prod the CL that implements the min_sdk_version attribute?",
