      "writtenOn": "2022-03-18T05:22:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The AIDL compiler in sc-mainline-prod is far from the on in master, so it is hard to cherry-pick the feature to sc-mainline-prod.\nInstead, how about declaring min_sdk_version in the backend field instead of top level? min_sdk_version in backend is allowed even in sc-mainline-prod\n\n    backend: {\n        java: {\n            apex_available: [\n                \"com.android.tethering\",\n            ],\n            min_sdk_version: \"30\",\n        },\n    },\n    \nplease let me know if it doesn\u0027t work.",
      "parentUuid": "cf81365c_3584986e",
      "revId": "600b10d636ba024d3c6499f91b61c554f17271de",
